WEBVTT

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.620
How did this happen?!

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.990
You're laughing so hard, Nyanko-sensei.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.930
In the first place, it's your fault we
became like this.

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.760
You are...Nyanko-sensei?!

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.620
You're not Himeragi?

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.100
I'm Yukina's master.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:35.940
It's not suprising that we can use
the same techniques.

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.010
That's true, but...

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:39.500
I'm sorry, Kanase.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.270
This guy's not Himeragi.

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:42.840
Hey, Kanase!

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.110
Oh my, oh my!

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:48.870
Well, she was held by the Fourth Primogenitor
running at full speed. It can't be helped, right?

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.660
Oh my, oh my, don't say that!

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.240
Damn, is there a place to rest?

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:00.990
This is a misunderstanding.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.620
We were just resting because we were tired.

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:06.560
Eh!? By "rest", I don't mean it like that.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.830
Even though it looks like this,
Kanon is a steady girl.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:17.590
If she trusts you and is willing to give herself
to you, I don't need to say anything else now.

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.920
No, the problem isn't that
she willing to give herself.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:25.740
But, as a man, you must take responsibility,
the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:29.150
You understand and said that on purpose, didn't you?

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:30.900
Father?

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.270
K-Kanase!

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:39.220
Yume-chan?!

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:41.780
Yume?

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:45.450
As a Lord? Even she is participating
in the Lords' War?

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:47.550
By the way, what's this TV show?

00:01:47.990 --> 00:01:52.480
It's ranking the lord candidates based on
their territory and followers.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.670
What?
Basically, it's just for show?!

00:01:55.670 --> 00:02:03.600
Well, it is a fight to the death between demons. For
most citizens, it's just a little bit of trouble.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.140
But there were already casualties...

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.850
I saw Nagisa-chan just now.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:12.360
Although it was just a little glimpse,
but I also saw Yaze.

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.510
Why are they in Yume's domain?

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.570
But, thankfully they are fine.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:17.490
Yeah.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.610
What? Kasuko? She as well?

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:24.700
Kasugaya Shizuri Castiella
of the Saikai Academy domain.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:30.750
She has 26 000 followers and is
11th place on the rankings.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:35.860
I see. Because Kasuko is an ogress,
and Yume is a succubus.

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.920
They are protecting everyone else as
Lord candidates.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:18.020
Ranking 24th, isn't that great?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:23.490
It's not just my power. It's thanks to
Lydianne-san and these children.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.780
Are you raising demon beasts here?

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.340
It's amazing.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:31.870
As expected of the most elite all-girls school in the Demon Sanctuary.

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:35.620
While Lilith's name is a bluff,
it helps a lot.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:40.280
I see, Yumebo also tried hard.
Great-Great!

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:44.830
Don't touch me like we're familiar.
And that rude nickname as well.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.140
Hey, Little Lord Candidate.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:50.470
We brought food for the demon beasts.
Can I put it here?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.900
Thank you, Ki-oniisan.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:56.600
Yume-chan is really cute today! I like you!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:59.690
Zana-oneesan, it hurts!

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:02.190
I feel like I've seen them somewhere?

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:03.680
Huh?

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:07.520
See you later, Akatsuki Kojou.
Have a good trip.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.270
What was that feeling just now?

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:14.230
Senpai...

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:17.580
Those two people, could they be...

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:20.400
Himeragi, what's wrong?

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:21.750
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.800
Aladar, what's wrong?

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:28.010
Did you see a suspicious couple?
Two people who stand out.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.470
Two people who stand out?

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:33.720
Ah, I met a guy named Ki.
Ki Juranbarada.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.390
Why do you know that person's name?

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:38.230
That person?

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:45.200
Ki Juranbarada is the one who rules the Warlord's Empire as
the First Primogenitor, codename being "Lost Warlord".

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:54.120
W-Why are you here?
Lost Warl-

00:05:54.120 --> 00:06:00.380
Don't.
You can't say that name. For now.

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:04.170
Why are you guys in Yume's domain?

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:09.480
That's true, I also wonder why.
Maybe because she's cute.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.950
Yume-dono, there's an intruder.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.910
At the main gate is people from the
Matsunaga domain, B-class 2.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:25.900
At the south gate people from Red Thunder, C-class 1,
and C-class 2 Jaws are gathering.

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:33.940
At the north gate, the Shironio Girls Academy domain. Their Lord is the Necromancer
and Witch of the Dead, Homeric. They are B-class 1.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:39.160
If we count all of their followers together, we get about 34 000.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:40.790
What a large number.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.830
What should we do, Yume-chan?

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:53.430
Surrender is not an option. Our opponents are all Lord candidates who are
hostile to Tensou Gakkan. What will happen if we are dominated by them?

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.900
That's true.

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:58.360
But how can we win? Even with Yume-chan...

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:03.440
Don't worry, leave this to Onee-san's party.

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.570
Zana-oneesan.

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:12.660
We have to pay for a room and meal.
That's the Japanese Bushido, isn't it?

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:30.510
I can understand the excitement of flaunting your
own power, but overbearing kids need to be punished.

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.930
Eh?! She punched a familiar?!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:46.560
Jeez! Young people these days can't
use their powers right!

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:54.700
Yume-chan!
At the north gate, there's a zombie from the Shironio domain.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:08:02.830
Did you make a large zombie by gathering
tons of corpses? That's pretty cruel.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:06.630
Okay, I'm going to return it to the soil.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:09.700
Bang!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.840
What?! What happened?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:25.810
Impossible. It's magic that reverses
the effect of the original magic.

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:30.820
Could it be that necromancy was
invalidated!? Is that even possible?

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:37.660
Magic Mute. Technique that nobody had been
able to use yet. He can use it easily?!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.290
Sorry, Ojou-chan.

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.870
Yume-dono!

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.710
A missile sent by Leviathan?!

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:05.420
This way just a warning shot, but...
Do you still want to fight?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:17.280
What is your purpose? Ki Juranbarada.
Why did you help Yume?

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:21.160
Don't tell me, you really are planning
to become the Lord of Itogami Island.

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.920
Oh, that sounds like tons of fun.

00:09:23.940 --> 00:09:24.790
Hey!

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:27.300
Just kidding, boy.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:34.960
Well, it's also true that I enjoyed this silly commotion.
Indeed, we still have an another purpose.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.000
Purpose?

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.800
Ghost Extermination!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:47.810
Anyway, how did you suddenly get here? You should still
be confined by the Manmade Island Management Corporation.

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:54.480
Because that place was destroyed.
There's no need to imprison me anymore.

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:59.600
Besides, on official records,
Kanase Kensei is not a criminal.

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:05.450
His situation is different from
other criminals who escaped from there.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.450
Escaped?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:10.550
Few of the Lord candidates are people
who escaped from prison.

00:10:10.550 --> 00:10:15.710
If they didn't, we wouldn't be such a
messy situation in just two days.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:17.260
I see.

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:22.740
But the really dangerous guys are managed
by Natsuki-chan, so it should be alright.

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.660
Huh? What's this silence?!

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.770
You'll know reason soon.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:39.240
We're moving.
Hold on to me, Kanon.

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:40.990
You as well,
the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:48.040
This place...is your laboratory?

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:50.300
Chairman!

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.630
Oh, Kanon.
You must be tired from the long journey.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.420
Did you get over jet lag?

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:56.270
I'm fine.

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.960
Is that the first thing you
should worry about?!

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:01.040
Why is Nina here?

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.150
I called her.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:07.780
The one who knows best how to repair a
homunculus is an alchemist.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:09.400
A homunculus?

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:10.340
Onii-san!

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:15.750
Astarte!
What does this mean?

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:17.570
What happened to Astarte?

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:19.440
Order the End.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.570
What?

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:28.740
The night Keystone Gate was attacked by Order the End,
Astarte went to help the Island Guard.

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.750
Together with Natsuki.

00:11:32.020 --> 00:11:37.290
The enemy has a magic sword that
can cut through a familiar's power.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:40.830
Order the End has a sword like Hawless.

00:11:41.900 --> 00:11:45.720
What about Natsuki-chan? There's no way
she would let Astarte become this.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:48.560
Minamiya Natsuki has been eaten.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:50.730
Eaten?

00:11:51.390 --> 00:12:01.320
Order the End used tentacles to catch and swallow Minamiya Natsuki. Astarte
witnessed it all. We don't know whether she's alive or dead.

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:06.780
What do you mean by being eaten? Natsuki-chan's
real body should be inside the Prison Barrier?!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.490
How could they hurt her?

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:09.790
Under normal circumstances.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:15.170
But it's different if the enemy has a Space Magician
more powerful than the Witch of the Void.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:22.720
Maybe they used her clone in the real world as a "key",
which made it possible to invade the Prison Barrier.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:26.800
What does Order the End want to
do with the Prison Barrier?

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:30.060
If I knew, we wouldn't have such troubles.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.080
It tastes awful.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.190
Don't you like it?

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:51.590
I don't mean to be rude, but it's worse
than Astarte's urine. It just suits you.

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:53.200
You damn girl!!

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:57.160
What's wrong? Can't you do it?

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:00.340
You can't do it, aren't you?

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:03.710
It would be a problem if I awoke, right?

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:06.630
Did you notice?

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:17.560
The tentacle grabbed me at Keystone Gate is the same type of
Guardian as my Rheingold, which means you accepted the same contract as me.

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:21.900
In other words, you must remain in
the Prison Barrier as a warden.

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.800
Isn't that right? Octopus girl.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:26.470
Stop it, Meriloe.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:35.700
We couldn't let you wake up because you are
the one who maintains this Prison Barrier.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.820
If there isn't a person to dream,
the dream will disappear.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.460
If you like dreams so much,
you should do it yourself.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:47.760
I know a good sleeping pill that works.
Or do you want me to sing a lullaby?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:53.760
That's a very tempting offer.
But unfortunately, I can't dream.

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:59.810
That's why I'm seeking your dreams.
Do you know the collective subconscious?

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.810
It's the foundation of magic.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:06.190
Being part of all people and races, the
collective subconscious of all mankind.

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:08.080
Yes, that's exactly it.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:11.410
One of the ways to get access
that is dreams.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:17.800
In other words all dreams are connected to
the collective subconscious.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:18.870
What?!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:24.380
In the deepest parts of your Prison Barrier,
there's a door that you don't know.

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:30.200
A door to another world that once existed.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.600
Rheingold!

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.000
Outis!

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:41.980
If Meriloe, who is also a prison warden
like you, we can open that door.

00:14:42.350 --> 00:14:47.740
The gate can be used to free the apostles
of Order the End imprisoned in the past.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.190
So that is it.

00:14:49.830 --> 00:14:56.320
Since ancient times there had been repeated terrorist
attacks in the name of the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:58.950
Is that Order the End's true identity?!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:04.920
Yeah. We are everywhere, in
every place in history.

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:13.010
The strongest vampire who was cursed by the Gods. So people will never forget the name of the Fourth Primogenitor.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:21.300
The Order the End's apostles of the previous era
are gathered in the Prison of the other world.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:31.240
I will free them. They will be resurrected in
this era's Itogami Island of this world.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.950
To give people true despair.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.680
What is the real purpose of Order the End?!

00:15:37.870 --> 00:15:43.920
In order to elect a new Lord. A new
King who can save people from despair.

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:48.670
Not just this Demon Sanctuary,
but the true Lord of this world.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.980
They already started moving. It's quite fast.

00:15:57.150 --> 00:16:04.190
Because of the victory just now, we shot to the top of the rankings.
They have decided to strike before we got even stronger.

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:10.440
Those people are second on the rankings,
the Special Liberation Army led by Lionel Yoshitani.

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:14.740
Their members are mostly the demon mercenaries of the former Island Guard?!

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.620
Those guys alone are already
difficult enough.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:22.040
That way are the 4th ranking
Paradise Chamber of Commerce domain.

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:27.330
Do they plan to take a bite from us when
we are exhausted? What a despicable guy.

00:16:27.340 --> 00:16:31.760
What should we do, Little Lord Candidate?
Should we start first?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:37.520
How is it possible to do that?! Our opponent
is a large-scale domain with 100 000 people.

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:42.920
Hey? This is kind of boring. Are we going
to stare at each other like this forever?

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:45.080
They are waiting for the night, right?

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:46.190
Night?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:51.200
Whether it's beast races or vampires, they
only show their true potential at night.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.180
What this...?

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.530
What the hell is this?

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.780
A gate to another world?!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.440
What's with this vibration?!

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:11.170
These are huge spatial vibrations.
I'm afraid it's Order The End.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:35.800
What the hell are you guys?!
Order the End!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.320
They're attacking indiscriminately.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:52.590
Dear everyone who wants to become the new Lord of
Itogami Island. This is the beginning of the true Lords' War.

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:59.430
Defeating the rival Lords, taking over their domains and followers.
The rules for these has not changed.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:07.270
Don't be careless. The apostles of Order the End
will attack every domain without exception.

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:13.480
A lord who has no power to protect their
followers is not qualified to rule Itogami Island.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:19.150
Please tell everyone inside the domain to
evacuate to Tensou Gakkan immediately.

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:20.400
I understand.

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:28.140
Lydianne, please verify the apostles' position and
ask for the demons' support inside each domain.

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:30.270
Okay, I'll complete these orders.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.480
I'm going with the demons to
fight the apostles.

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.320
Yeah, leave this place to me.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:44.010
But this situation is still too bad, there are too
many enemies. This place is hard to protect like this.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.380
Hey, Zana. What do you think about this?

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:49.600
Oh well, it feels a bit strange.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:51.400
Strange?...What is it?

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:55.070
How should I say this, their style
looks too disconnected.

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:55.950
Style?

00:18:55.990 --> 00:19:01.800
Magic also has popularity and fads.
Even with magic of same effect,

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:05.580
the style changes depending on the
country, race or era.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:09.410
Vampire's familiars also change
with the times.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:14.330
Familiar's appearances are based
on the imagination of the host.

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:19.060
With the four elements becoming popular,
physical types becoming trendy once again.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:21.590
It's about a 300 year cycle.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:23.390
What?!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:26.600
So, since their magic looks disconnected,
its because...

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:30.270
They're not apostles of the same era.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.910
I think so. Do you want to confirm it?

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:48.120
As I thought. These guys aren't people
from this era or even this world.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:53.470
They borrowed power from tasteless mask,
appearing here temporarily.

00:19:53.590 --> 00:19:55.390
So, if we destroy their masks...

00:19:55.430 --> 00:19:58.380
They'll be forced to return
to the Prison Barrier.

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.090
Yumebo, Tank Rider!

00:20:00.140 --> 00:20:02.550
I already told you, please don't
call me that!

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:05.880
We have to destroy their masks, right?
I understand!

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:10.770
We can do it?!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:15.340
The Paradise Chamber of Commerce.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:18.440
The timing of them attack this domain means...

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:20.820
Damn, the goal of those guys is...

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:22.070
Yume-chan!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.560
Yumebo!

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:40.030
Are you okay, Yume-chan?
I did it in time, thank goodness.

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.660
Yukina-oneesan!

00:20:42.060 --> 00:20:45.760
It's okay now. We'll protect you.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.340
We?

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:54.020
I'm the Lord of the Saikai Academy domain,
Kasugaya Shizuri Castiella.

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:56.560
I'm here to help you!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.470
Himeragi-chan?!

00:21:00.140 --> 00:21:01.760
Somehow it's alright...

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:06.620
As expected, that girl was the
Fourth Primogenitor's Blood Servant.

00:21:06.670 --> 00:21:11.510
Don't break her yet, Zana. If you destroy her,
I won't have an opponent to play with me.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.840
Hmm, what should I do?

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.680
And there is that girl.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:20.750
The white-haired ogress and Hawless, isn't it?!

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:24.630
As expected of the Demon Sanctuary,
I won't get bored.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:27.630
It was worth to make a special trip here.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:30.920
Come, Mesarthim Adamas!

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:38.680
What do you achieve by destroying the building?

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:41.270
It's not like I want to do that!

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:44.480
Jeez, they keep coming one after another.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:52.120
The other party is using the Prison Barrier as a
gate. They'll keep coming as long as it's not closed.

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:54.750
Close it? How do I close it?

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.040
I see.
We have to get Natsuki-chan back.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:21:59.920
Yeah.

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:06.900
Originally, it would be difficult to reach the Prison
Barrier from the outside, but since the door is open now...

00:22:06.900 --> 00:22:14.100
If there's a Magician who can use spatial techniques,
it can somehow work. Isn't that right, Kanase Kensei?

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:21.650
Good grief, it is easy for you to say. I
can't guarantee that you will reach it safely.

00:22:22.390 --> 00:22:27.000
It doesn't matter. I just need to knock down
the witch from Order the End, right?

00:22:27.300 --> 00:22:28.960
Let's do it, Oyaji-san.

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:32.530
I have no reason to be called father-in-law by you.

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:34.530
I didn't mean it that way.

00:22:34.710 --> 00:22:35.920
I won't let you!

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:40.150
Oyaji-san!

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:48.220
If possible, I didn't want to see you again
in this form, but I have no other choice.

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:52.890
I can't free Minamiya Natsuki yet.

00:22:53.110 --> 00:22:54.580
The Blood!

00:22:54.890 --> 00:22:57.810
Nyanko-sensei! I leave Kanase's father to you!

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:00.760
Come, Regulus Aurum!

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:03.560
Show up, Primus Aurum!
